Spoiler? Not really...

Try to use either a stethoscope (which are rather common in the game)
or a wand of probing.  Then you see their stats and can decide for
youself.

It really depends a lot on what do you have at hand to fight with.
It's one thing trying to kill them from a distance with a powerful
wand or poisoned arrows, and quite another trying to take them up
with a cursed dagger.  

Unless it is a dire emergency, I don't try to fight them at close quarters
unless I'm level 12 or so, with a good weapon and good armor.  They are
tough (for low level characters that is :)

Good luck!
